# AI Agent Rules for BookmarkFlow

Always read `AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md` before starting any major task in this repository.

Key rules:
1. This is a Vanilla JS / CSS / HTML project. No bundlers, no React, no Tailwind.
2. Manifest V3 constraints apply (no inline scripts, strict CSP).
3. All state is managed in `popup.js`.
4. All LLM calls happen in `api.js` with exponential backoff.
5. All Chrome Bookmark API calls happen in `bookmarks.js`.
6. Maintain the premium, dark-mode-first aesthetic in `popup.css`.
